{"id": "69316", "title": "都市情侠风云录", "author": "黄龙天翔", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 10, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/69/69316.htm", "intro": "我，萧桐，男，今年二十有五，天津静海人氏，七月份刚刚大本毕业。由于那个在我眼中失去了全部活力的城市都市情侠风云录已经没有任何值得我留恋的东西，我从上了大学后就压根儿没想回去过，只是为了处理父母的后事回去过一次。大学毕业后我来到Ｘ市这个中小城市，打算在这里开始我新的生活", "base": "files/article/html/69/69316", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "10613936.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "10613937.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "10613938.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "10613939.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-24", "file": "10613940.html", "available": false}, {"title": "25-29", "file": "10613941.html", "available": false}, {"title": "30-34", "file": "10613942.html", "available": false}, {"title": "35-39", "file": "10613943.html", "available": false}, {"title": "40-43", "file": "10613944.html", "available": false}, {"title": "44-48", "file": "10613945.html", "available": false}]}